<title>USA: CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 760 contracts.</title>
<headline>CBOT overnight Project A ag volume 760 contracts.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chicago Board of Trade said its Project A overnight agricultural trading volume totaled 760 contracts compared with 1,045 overnight Sunday.</p>
<p>There were 58 wheat, 209 corn, 355 soybean, 36 soymeal, 72 soyoil, 29 oat and one corn call traded.</p>
<p>In overnight trading, wheat was 1/4 to one cent lower, corn was 1/4 to 3/4 cent lower and soybeans were steady to 1/2 cent higher.</p>
<p>((Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8721))</p>
</text>
